  "special_rules_definitions": {
    "Boing": "When this unit is activated, you may place all models with this rule in it anywhere within D3+1\" of their position.",
    "Bombing Run(X)": "Once per activation, when this model moves over enemy units, pick one of them and roll X dice. For each 2+ it takes 3 hits with AP(1).",
    "Destructive": "This model may move through enemy units. Whenever it does, pick one of them and roll one die. On a 4+ it takes 3 hits with AP(1).",
    "Instigator": "Once per this unit's activation, before attacking, pick one other friendly unit within 12\", which may move by up to 6\".",
    "Nasty": "Gets +1 to hit in melee.",
    "Power Shrooms": "Once per this unit's activation, pick one friendly unit within 12\", which gets +1 to hit next time it fights in melee.",
    "Shaman Circle": "Pick one model in this unit to have Caster(X), where X is the total number of models with this rule in this unit...",
    "Surprise Attack(X)": "This model counts as having Ambush, and may be deployed up to 1\" away from enemy units...",
    "Takedown": "Once per game, when this model attacks in melee, you may pick one model in the unit as its target, and make 1 attack at Quality 2+ with AP(1) and Deadly(3).",
    "Warning Cry": "Enemy units using Ambush must be set up over 12\" away from this model."
  },
